{"trace_id": "552ece76-a2da-4636-baf5-3f93fe1fbde0", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-006", "text": "写个脚本，当PT101变化时执行更新", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:39:47.837Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:39:52.827Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:39:47.837Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:39:52.827Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3167000033718068, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1254999990342185, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005199999577598646, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1027, "output_tokens": 154, "latency_ms": 2085.9960000016144, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查看一下系统中现有的脚本和点位信息，以便更好地为您配置脚本。", "reasoning": "用户想要为一个点（PT101）编写一个脚本，当该点变化时执行（on_change 触发器）。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要先看看当前系统中已有的脚本和点信息，然后再进行后续操作。\n\n首先，让我列出已有的脚本和点信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7237, "output_tokens": 220, "latency_ms": 2882.535900000221, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，目前系统中有以下信息：\n\n- **点位 PT101**：已存在，类型为 **analog（模拟量）**\n- **现有脚本**：暂无\n\n您希望创建一个 **on_change**（值变化触发）脚本，绑定到 **PT101**。但您提到\"执行更新\"，请问这个脚本具体要执行什么逻辑呢？例如：\n\n1. **更新某个其他点位**？比如当 PT101 变化时，将值写入另一个点（如 PT102）？\n2. **触发某个报警或动作**？\n3. **通过脚本进行数据计算或转换**？\n\n请您提供脚本的具体行为，我来帮您创建。", "reasoning": "好的，系统中有 PT101 这个点位（analog 类型），但没有现成的脚本。\n\n用户想要一个脚本，当 PT101 变化时执行更新。这是一个 on_change 类型的脚本，绑定到 PT101 标签。\n\n但用户没说具体要执行什么逻辑。\"执行更新\" - 具体更新什么？我需要问清楚脚本的具体内容。\n\n让我向用户确认脚本的详细需求。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8264, "output_tokens": 374, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 4988.887300001807}, "judge": null}
