ts", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3561000014306046, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point", "delete_point", "update_point", "list_points", "get_interface"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["bind_point", "rename_page", "create_page", "list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "get_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["enable_history", "list_history", "disable_history", "set_retention", "verify_zone"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_text", "apply_flow_layout", "group_widgets"]}, {"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["add_trend_pen"]}, {"name": "manage_reports", "allowed_actions": ["configure_report_schedule", "generate_report"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["set_schedule_trigger", "update_restore", "verify_buffer"]}, {"name": "manage_databases", "allowed_actions": ["create_view", "verify_status"]}, {"name": "manage_notifications", "allowed_actions": ["test_profile"]}, {"name": "manage_security", "allowed_actions": ["update_actuator"]}], "visible_count": 11, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "create_point", "args": {"action": "create_point", "tag": "Press_1", "type": "analog", "unit": "MPa", "min": 0, "max": 10, "description": "压力点位 Press_1"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"tag": "Press_1"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"points.Press_1": {"tag": "Press_1", "type": "analog", "unit": "MPa", "min": 0.0, "max": 10.0, "description": "压力点位 Press_1"}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.297299997531809, "intended_entities": ["points.Press_1"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:0b2065b2f3c97bb30217660ca332e9d49ea82b18231bca4275917a1ccc32c1d1", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6248, "output_tokens": 255, "latency_ms": 4163.755199999287, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查一下现有的点位信息，看看是否已有同名点位。", "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个名为\"Press_1\"的压力点位。先看看当前已有的点位信息，然后创建一个analog类型的点。\n\n\"压力\"通常是一个模拟量（analog）点位，有工程单位。我先创建这个点，单位设为\"MPa\"或\"Bar\"比较合适。先看看有没有叫\"Press_1\"的点，或者直接创建。\n\n我先查询一下现有的点位，避免冲突。但用户说\"搞个压力点位\"，应该是直接创建。\n\n让我先看看现有点位列表。\n\n不过我想先创建，因为没有要求必须先查询。但稳妥起见，先看看列表。\n\n其实可以直接创建，因为用户明确说了名字。我来创建这个analog点。压力单位通常用MPa、bar、kPa等，我先用常见单位。不过用户没指定单位，我可以先问问或者先用默认。\n\n先创建吧，可以用\"MPa\"作为默认单位。\n\n等等，我应该先查一下现有点位，看看是否已存在。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6540, "output_tokens": 226, "latency_ms": 2413.7890999991214, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "目前系统中还没有任何点位。现在为您创建压力点位 **Press_1**：", "reasoning": "当前没有点位。我来为用户创建一个名为\"Press_1\"的压力点位。压力是模拟量，单位通常用MPa、bar、kPa等。用户没有指定单位，我先用常见的\"MPa\"作为单位，并设置合理的量程范围。如果用户有特殊需求可以后面再调整。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6803, "output_tokens": 262, "latency_ms": 3029.572100000223, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **点位创建成功！**\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **点位名称** | `Press_1` |\n| **类型** | analog（模拟量） |\n| **工程单位** | MPa |\n| **量程范围** | 0 ~ 10 MPa |\n| **描述** | 压力点位 Press_1 |\n\n目前已经为您创建好了压力点位，请问接下来还需要进一步配置吗？比如：\n\n- 🖥️ **绑定到 HMI 页面** — 将 Press_1 显示在画面上\n- 🔔 **添加报警** — 如压力过高/过低报警\n- 📊 **开启历史记录** — 记录压力变化趋势\n- 📈 **添加到趋势曲线** — 查看实时/历史趋势图\n\n请告诉我您的需求！", "reasoning": "创建成功了。我设置的单位是 MPa（兆帕），量程 0~10。这个应该符合一般压力点位的要求。接下来要告知用户，同时询问是否需要进一步配置（比如绑定到页面、添加报警、开启历史记录等）。不过用户只是说了\"搞个压力点位\"，已经完成了，我可以问用户是否需要下一步操作。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，已经完成。可以问用户是否需要进一步配置。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19591, "output_tokens": 743, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9652.043999998568}, "judge": null}
