上？例如 `value`（数值）、`color`（颜色）、`visible`（可见性）等。\n\n请提供这些信息，我好进一步帮您操作。", "reasoning": "There's one page called \"主画面\" (main page) with id \"main_page\". \n\nNow, the user wants to \"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\" - bind pump 1 on the main page to motor 3.\n\nThis likely means:\n1. There's already a widget called \"泵1\" (pump1) on the main page, and they want to bind it to a tag related to \"马达3\" (motor 3).\n2. Or they want to create a pump widget called \"泵1\" and bind it.\n\nBut I'm not sure if the widget \"泵1\" already exists. Let me think... Actually, the user said \"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\" which implies pump 1 already exists on the main page.\n\nLet me also check what devices exist. Let me see... I don't have a tool to list devices directly. But I can check what's available.\n\nActually, \"bind_point\" is available under manage_pages. The user wants to bind a point (tag) to a widget property. \n\n\"泵1\" might be a widget ID, and \"马达3\" might be a device or a tag name.\n\nLet me first check if there's any information about devices or points. But I don't have a \"list devices\" or \"list points\" tool available directly. Let me check the available tools again...\n\nI have `manage_devices` with `create_device` action only. Not a list action.\n\nI think the most likely interpretation is:\n- There's a pump widget (widget_id = \"pump1\" or \"泵1\") on the \"main_page\"\n- They want to bind it to a tag/point associated with \"马达3\" (motor 3)\n\nBut I need more information. Let me ask the user to clarify what tag exactly they want to bind, and what widget ID \"泵1\" corresponds to.\n\nActually, maybe the widget is literally called \"泵1\" and they want to bind it to a point tag called something like \"motor_3\" or \"马达3\".\n\nLet me ask the user for more details since I don't know:\n1. What the exact widget ID for \"泵1\" is\n2. What tag (point) name corresponds to \"马达3\"\n\nLet me ask the user for clarification."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 12905, "output_tokens": 899, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8915.412199999992}, "judge": null}
