果您还需要为此点位配置报警、历史记录、绑定到 HMI 页面等操作，可以随时告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "成功创建了点位。现在需要告知用户完成情况并结束任务。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 14703, "output_tokens": 456, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 5211.142799998925}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "d955cf48-0772-44a6-91cd-7a10b4409fff", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-035", "text": "帮我改一下那个画面，颜色好看点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:39.722Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:46.545Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:39.722Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:41.592Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:41.592Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:48:46.545Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages", "create_widget", "create_page"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4119999977992848, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1311, "output_tokens": 127, "latency_ms": 1865.8600999988266, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查一下当前项目中都有哪些画面，看看具体哪个需要调整。", "reasoning": "用户让我改一下画面的颜色，但我不确定具体是哪个画面，也不清楚当前的画面状态。我应该先查看已有的页面列表，了解当前有哪些页面。\n\n根据当前阶段 MANAGE_PAGES，我拥有 manage_pages 工具，可以执行 list_pages 操作。让我先列出所有页面看看。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 1925, "output_tokens": 375, "latency_ms": 4949.4776999999885, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前系统中还没有任何页面和图形元素，所以目前没有现成的画面可以“改”哦。\n\n请问您是否想让我从零开始为您新建一个画面布局？比如您想创建一个什么样的工业监控画面？可以告诉我：\n\n1. **画面用途**：如水处理、管道监控、罐区等\n2. **需要哪些元素**：比如管道（线条）、罐体（圆形/矩形）、设备（矩形）、文字标签等\n3. **喜欢的颜色风格**：比如蓝色系、深色背景、浅色背景等\n\n请您描述一下想要的画面设计，我来帮您创建并搭配好看的颜色！🎨", "reasoning": "当前没有页面，我处于 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段，需要用 manage_graphics 工具来创建图形元素。但用户说\"帮我改一下那个画面，颜色好看点\"，目前没有页面和图形，所以没办法\"改\"。\n\n我需要先向用户说明当前情况：还没有任何画面和图形元素存在。我应该先问问用户想要创建什么样的画面，或者是否要新建一个画面，然后再进行美化调整。\n\n不过等等，我当前的阶段是 GENERATE_LAYOUT，可用工具是 manage_graphics（创建圆形、矩形、文本、线条）和 manage_pages（list_pages）。但是我没有 create_page 的工具。让我看看...\n\nmanage_pages 只有 list_pages 一个 action。那我没有创建页面的工具。\n\n让我重新审视一下。当前阶段是 GENERATE_LAYOUT，可用工具是 manage_graphics（四种绘图动作）和 manage_pages（仅 list_pages）。\n\n用户说\"改一下那个画面\"，但目前没有页面。我需要告知用户当前没有画面，并询问他想要什么样的画面布局，然后从头开始创建。\n\n但用户说\"改\"，而不是\"新建\"。也许用户以为已经有画面了。我需要澄清一下。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "GraphicsLayout"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3236, "output_tokens": 502, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 6823.916299999837}, "judge": null}
