tool_use", "text": "当前项目还没有任何点位。让我为您添加几个常用的传感器点，涵盖温度、压力、流量、液位和状态等类型。", "reasoning": "The project has no points yet. I'll add several common sensor points for a typical SCADA system. Let me think about what kinds of sensors are commonly needed:\n\n1. **Temperature sensor** - analog point, unit: °C, e.g. TEMP_001\n2. **Pressure sensor** - analog point, unit: bar/kPa, e.g. PRESS_001\n3. **Flow sensor** - analog point, unit: L/min, e.g. FLOW_001\n4. **Level sensor** - analog point, unit: %, e.g. LEVEL_001\n5. **Pump status** - digital point (on/off), e.g. PUMP_001_STS\n\nLet me add these as a reasonable set of sensor points."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 8840, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 2559.3831000005594, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已完成！为您创建了 **5 个传感器点**，汇总如下：\n\n| 点位标签 | 类型 | 工程单位 | 量程 | 说明 |\n|-----------|------|----------|------|------|\n| **TEMP_001** | `analog` | °C | -50 ~ 300 | 1号反应器温度传感器 |\n| **PRESS_001** | `analog` | bar | 0 ~ 100 | 1号反应器压力传感器 |\n| **FLOW_001** | `analog` | L/min | 0 ~ 500 | 进料管道流量传感器 |\n| **LEVEL_001** | `analog` | % | 0 ~ 100 | 储罐液位传感器 |\n| **PUMP_001_STS** | `digital` | - | - | 1号泵运行状态（运行/停止） |\n\n涵盖了常见的 **温度、压力、流量、液位** 模拟量以及一个 **泵状态** 数字量。您看还需要再加其他点，或者接下来进行报警配置、历史归档、页面布局等其他操作吗？", "reasoning": "All 5 points were created successfully. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 24366, "output_tokens": 1207, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10645.618300000933}, "judge": null}
