e"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.chem_panel", "pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_01", "points.TT_01"]}, {"turn": 3, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["bind_point", "create_widget", "list_pages", "create_page"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["group_widgets", "apply_flow_layout", "create_circle", "create_rect", "create_line", "create_text", "delete_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["delete_point", "create_point", "update_point"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "disable_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "delete_alarm", "set_threshold"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["disable_history", "query_history", "enable_history", "list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["add_trend_pen"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["set_schedule_trigger", "create_schedule"]}, {"name": "manage_users", "allowed_actions": ["create_user"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_reports", "allowed_actions": ["configure_report_schedule"]}], "visible_count": 11, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "bind_point", "args": {"action": "bind_point", "page_id": "chem_panel", "widget_id": "tank_01", "property": "pressure", "tag": "PT_01"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"binding": "tank_01.pressure=PT_01"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_01.bindings.pressure": "PT_01"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.0136999990209006, "intended_entities": ["pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_01.bindings.pressure"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.chem_panel", "pages.chem_panel.widgets.tank_01", "points.PT_01"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:6e1059cfd20dcf8e36c0f8aed83e1441104cd8e18cd4668cdb6edaa746478909", "final_hash": "sha256:8a544e03a3f6a359c38a90ee29d2c89cd4dfe0d0ab82936a22765be5f8e19c7b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 249, "latency_ms": 2602.350300003309, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来先查一下当前已有的页面和点位信息，看看 `chem_panel` 页面以及 `LT_01`、`TT_01`、`PT_01` 这些点位是否存在。", "reasoning": "当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要分析用户的需求。\n\n用户的需求：\n1. 在 chem_panel 页面画一个罐体（Tank）\n2. 液位绑定 LT_01\n3. 温度绑定 TT_01\n4. 压力绑定 PT_01\n\n这涉及到页面管理（查看页面、绑定控件）和点位管理（查看点位是否存在）。\n\n首先，我需要先查询当前已有的页面和点位信息，看看 chem_panel 是否存在，以及 LT_01、TT_01、PT_01 这些点位是否存在。\n\n让我先调用 list_pages 和 list_points。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 8060, "output_tokens": 354, "latency_ms": 3878.610399999161, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 `chem_panel` 和三个点位都已存在，非常好！现在我在 `chem_panel` 上创建一个罐体（tank）控件，然后绑定三个属性。", "reasoning": "很好！页面 `chem_panel` 已经存在，并且点位 `LT_01`（液位，单位m）、`TT_01`（温度，单位°C）、`PT_01`（压力，单位MPa）都已经创建好了。\n\n接下来，我需要：\n1. 在 `chem_panel` 页面上创建一个 tank（罐体）控件\n2. 然后将液位（可以通过 tank 的 `level` 属性绑定 LT_01）\n3. 温度（tank 的 `temperature` 属性绑定 TT_01）\n4. 压力（tank 的 `pressure` 属性绑定 PT_01）\n\n让我先创建 tank 控件。根据 create_widget 的参数，我需要指定 type 为 'tank'，并指定位置和尺寸。\n\n然后依次绑定三个属性。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 8465, "output_tokens": 404, "latency_ms": 3273.405100000673, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体创建成功，现在来绑定液位、温度和压力三个属性。", "reasoning": "罐体创建成功了。现在需要绑定三个属性：\n1. 液位（level）→ LT_01\n2. 温度（temperature）→ TT_01\n3. 压力（pressure）→ PT_01\n\n这些绑定可以同时进行，因为互相没有依赖关系。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 8992, "output_tokens": 296, "latency_ms": 3437.6895999994304, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "所有操作均已成功完成！下面是配置汇总：\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 配置完成总结\n\n**页面**：`chem_panel`（化工面板）\n\n**控件**：\n| 控件ID | 类型 | 位置 | 尺寸 |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| `tank_01` | 🏭 罐体 | (200, 150) | 300×500 |\n\n**绑定关系**：\n| 属性 | 绑定点位 | 说明 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `level` → `LT_01` | 液位（m） | ✅ 已绑定 |\n| `temperature` → `TT_01` | 温度（°C） | ✅ 已绑定 |\n| `pressure` → `PT_01` | 压力（MPa） | ✅ 已绑定 |\n\n在 **chem_panel** 页面上已成功放置了一个罐体控件，液位、温度、压力分别对应 `LT_01`、`TT_01`、`PT_01` 三个 SCADA 点位，用户可以在 HMI 上实时查看这三个工艺参数了。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "所有操作都成功了。让我总结一下完成的工作。现在需要校验一下项目，确保没有遗漏。\n\n用户只是要求画一个罐体并绑定，没有说要校验部署等操作。所以我已完成了所有任务，可以标记 DONE 了。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 26505, "output_tokens": 1303, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 13253.598000002967}, "judge": null}
