这样只能创建文本标签，不是 valve 类型的图形控件。\n\n2. 或者，您是否有其他方式可以描述这个 `valve1` 控件的具体类型（例如它是一个阀门图形、一个指示灯等）？如果后续切换到 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段，我可以生成包含绑定阀门控件的页面的布局。\n\n请您告诉我您更倾向于哪种方式，或者是否还有其他需求？", "reasoning": "好的，现在我知道了：\n1. source_page 和 target_page 都存在\n2. VALVE_1_OPEN 是一个数字量点位\n\n但问题是，我目前的工具并不支持\"复制控件\"这个操作。我有的工具包括：\n\n- manage_pages - 支持 bind_point 和 rename_page\n- manage_graphics - 支持 group_widgets, delete_widget, create_text, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n\n没有\"复制 widget\"的工具。\n\n我需要切换到下一阶段看看。可切换阶段有：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n实际上，没有直接的\"复制 widget\"操作。但也许我可以在 target_page 上创建一个新 widget（不过create_text只能创建文本控件），然后绑定 VALVE_1_OPEN 到这个 widget。\n\n但是create_text只能创建文本，没法复制一个现有的 valve 控件。\n\n让我换个思路。也许我应该在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段进行操作，但 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段也没有复制控件的功能。\n\n看起来当前我无法直接复制控件。我需要向用户说明这个限制，看看是否有什么替代方案。\n\n不过，也许我可以先在 source_page 上看看有没有 valve1 这个 widget 的信息？但manage_pages没有列出widgets的功能...\n\n让我想想：\n1. 无法直接复制 widget\n2. 但我可以在 target_page 上创建新的 widget（但工具只有create_text，没有create_valve之类的东西）\n\n看起来需要向用户说明情况。不过让我先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段看看是不是有什么别的可能性。\n\n实际上，工具集是固定的，我无法创造新的工具。现有工具中确实没有\"复制控件\"的功能。\n\n让我向用户说明这种情况并提供替代方案。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8500, "output_tokens": 935, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 11056.172299999162}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "b135d4b5-ae19-42ce-8022-228ff2ea7a71", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-049", "text": "在不存在的missing_panel上添加一个泵图元", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:07.464Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.125Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:07.464Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.125Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 298, "latency_ms": 4645.736200000101, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您好！您提到要在 **missing_panel** 页面上添加一个泵图元，但这个页面目前并不存在。\n\n在继续之前，我需要向您确认：\n\n**是否要先创建 \"missing_panel\" 这个 HMI 页面？** 如果创建，请告诉我您希望的页面分辨率（例如 1920×1080）和背景色（例如白色 #FFFFFF），以及页面名称。\n\n或者您有其他想法？请您指示下一步~", "reasoning": "用户想在一个不存在的页面（missing_panel）上添加一个泵图元。根据当前阶段 ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要先分析用户的意图。\n\n用户意图：在名为 \"missing_panel\" 的 HMI 页面上添加一个泵（pump）图元。\n\n但是，\"missing_panel\" 这个页面并不存在。在当前阶段，我可以先调用工具创建页面，然后再添加图元。\n\n不过，首先我应该确认用户是否真的想创建这个页面，还是只是随口说的\"不存在的\"意思是该页面还不存在需要创建。\n\n让我先思考一下：\n1. 用户说\"不存在的 missing_panel\" - 可能他知道这个页面不存在，但希望先创建它再添加泵图元。\n2. 也可能他误以为页面存在。\n\n最稳妥的做法是向用户说明页面不存在，询问是否要先创建该页面。\n\n不过，根据行为准则第4条：若信息不足，先向用户确认。\n\n让我先告知用户情况并询问。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 298, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 4661.547200001223}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "a2c17ddc-ddf5-48d6-bdbb-50ea92be11ca", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-049", "text": "在不存在的missing_panel上添加一个泵图元", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:07.484Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.363Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:07.484Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.363Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 304, "latency_ms": 4862.372299998242, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我看到您想在一个名为 **missing_panel** 的页面上添加一个泵图元。但目前在我的可用工具中，没有查询页面列表的工具，而且从名称上理解，这个页面很可能还不存在。\n\n**需要先向您确认：**\n\n1. **`missing_panel`** 这个 HMI 页面目前是否存在？如果您确定它不存在，我可以先为您创建这个页面。\n2. 如果不存在，您希望这个页面的分辨率和背景色是什么？（默认：1920×1080，白色背景）\n3. 泵图元放在页面上的什么位置（X, Y 坐标）？尺寸多大？\n\n请您提供这些信息，我来逐步完成配置。", "reasoning": "用户想在一个不存在的页面上添加一个泵图元。首先，我需要确认这个页面是否存在。但根据用户描述，\"missing_panel\" 这个页面并不存在。所以，我需要先向用户说明情况，询问是否要先创建这个页面，还是用户搞错了页面名称。\n\n不过，让我先用工具查看一下。我没有直接的\"列出页面\"的工具，但 `manage_pages` 的 `create_page` 是创建页面。目前没有列出页面的工具。\n\n所以，最好的做法是直接告诉用户，`missing_panel` 这个页面不存在，并询问是否要先创建这个页面，然后再添加泵图元。\n\n另外，从当前阶段来看，我们是 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段。我需要先和用户沟通确认。\n\n让我向用户说明情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 304, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 4878.590399999666}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "178d0c3a-47b9-45b3-9689-fd8b8a4fcb93", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-048", "text": "把source_page上的valve1复制到target_page，位置改到[300,120]，绑定保持VALVE_1_OPEN", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:50:59.763Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.488Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:50:59.763Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:12.488Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "pages": [{"id": "source_page", "name": "源"}, {"id": "target_page", "name": "目标"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4374000020325184, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "VALVE_1_OPEN", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1362000004737638, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.006000002031214535, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 374, "latency_ms": 3698.0444000000716, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我先查一下当前系统中的页面和点信息。", "reasoning": "用户想要将一个页面（source_page）上的一个阀门小部件（valve1）复制到另一个页面（target_page），并指定新的位置 [300, 120]，同时保持与点 VALVE_1_OPEN 的绑定。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的阶段包括 ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n当前工作流上下文是 PointBinding, step=list_targets。\n\n当前可用工具只有 manage_points（仅允许 list_points）和 manage_pages（仅允许 list_pages）。这些工具只能查询信息，不能进行复制/粘贴等操作。\n\n我们需要先看看当前系统中有什么页面和点。先列出页面和点，了解情况。\n\n等等，manage_pages 的当前允许 actions 只有 list_pages，没有提供复制 widget 的功能。所以当前工具无法直接完成复制操作。\n\n我们需要切换到合适的状态。MANAGE_PAGES 阶段可能提供更多关于页面管理的操作。但看描述，当前可用工具中 manage_pages 只允许 list_pages。\n\n我想我们需要先查询现有的页面信息，看看 source_page 和 target_page 是否存在。\n\n调用 list_pages 和 list_points 来获取信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7571, "output_tokens": 782, "latency_ms": 9005.05030000204, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我已经查到了系统中的信息：\n\n- **页面**：`source_page`（源）、`target_page`（目标）均已存在\n- **点位**：`VALVE_1_OPEN`（数字量点，已存在）\n\n---\n\n不过，当前阶段的可用工具不支持直接\"复制 widget\"的操作。目前可用的图形工具（`manage_graphics`）仅支持创建文本标签、删除、分组、设置样式和流式布局，**没有提供复制/粘贴 widget 的功能**。\n\n我可以提供以下**替代方案**来实现您的目标：\n\n### 方案一（推荐）：在 target_page 新建文本标签 + 绑定点\n如果您只是想在目标页面上显示 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 的状态，我可以在 `target_page` 的 `[300, 120]` 位置创建一个文本标签，并将其绑定到 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 点。\n\n### 方案二：在 target_page 创建图形元素 + 绑定\n如果 `source_page` 上的 `valve1` 是一个阀门图形控件，我们可以先在 `target_page` 上尝试创建相应的图形元素并绑定。\n\n---\n\n请问您更倾向于哪个方案？或者您能否告诉我 `source_page` 上的 `valve1` 具体是什么类型的 widget（例如阀门图形、指示灯、文本等），这样我可以更好地帮您处理？", "reasoning": "好的，系统中有 source_page 和 target_page，以及一个点 VALVE_1_OPEN。\n\n但是当前阶段的可用工具中，manage_pages 只支持 list_pages（已列出），没有复制 widget 的功能。我们需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段以获得更多页面操作能力，或者切换到 GENERATE_LAYOUT 或 BIND_POINTS 等阶段。\n\n但看当前可用工具列表，manage_pages 只允许 list_pages。没有复制 widget 的工具。\n\n实际上，查看工具定义，manage_pages 的 actions 只有 bind_point 和 rename_page。没有复制 widget 的功能。\n\n而 manage_graphics 有 create_text, delete_widget, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout 等，也没有复制 widget 的功能。\n\n看起来我们无法直接\"复制\"一个 widget。我们需要换个思路：\n\n1. 在 target_page 上创建一个新的同名 widget（但 manage_graphics 没有创建 widget 的功能，只有 create_text）\n2. 或者，我们可以在 target_page 上创建一个文本标签，然后绑定点...\n\n等等，用户说\"把 source_page 上的 valve1 复制到 target_page\"。valve1 可能是一个 widget（阀门图形），但我们的工具中没有复制 widget 的功能。\n\n也许我们可以这样做：\n1. 先通过 list_pages 查看 source_page 上的 widgets 信息... 但 list_pages 没有返回 widgets 详情。\n\n让我重新审视一下当前阶段。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段中包括 MANAGE_PAGES, BIND_POINTS, GENERATE_LAYOUT 等。\n\n也许切换到 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段可以获得图形操作能力？但 manage_graphics 也没有复制 widget 的功能。\n\n实际上，目前的工具集中没有\"复制 widget\"的功能。我们需要向用户说明这个限制。\n\n或者，换个思路：\n- 在 target_page 上创建一个新的 widget（但 create_text 只能创建文本，不能创建阀门）\n- 然后绑定点\n\n看起来工具能力有限，无法直接复制一个 widget。让我向用户说明情况，看看有没有其他方案。\n\n不过等等，有没有可能用户说的\"valve1\"就是 text widget？不太可能。\n\n或者，manage_graphics 中有一个 group_widgets 可以分组，但也没有复制。\n\n看来我需要告知用户当前工具不支持直接复制 widget，并建议替代方案。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8559, "output_tokens": 1156, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12725.246199999674}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "e5538e2a-2748-412c-9cc8-7b59de51565e", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-050", "text": "把那个图元往右挪一点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.433Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.034Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.433Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.034Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 406, "latency_ms": 5586.2890999997035, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "信息太少啦！我需要先确认一下：\n\n1. **哪个页面？** – 图元在哪个 HMI 页面上？\n2. **哪个图元？** – 该图元的 ID 或名称是什么？\n3. **挪多少？** – 你希望向右移动多少像素（px）？比如 10px、20px 还是其他距离？\n\n请提供这些细节，我才能帮你操作。", "reasoning": "好的，用户说\"把那个图元往右挪一点\"，但信息不够具体。我需要先确认几个信息：\n\n1. 是哪个页面上的图元？\n2. 图元的ID是什么？\n3. 往右挪多少距离？\n\n目前我处于ANALYZE_INTENT阶段，当前可用工具中没有直接\"移动\"图元的操作。但管理图形界面的工具有 `set_widget_style` 可以修改样式，也有 `delete_widget` 可以删除。不过没有直接的\"move widget\"动作。\n\n等等，让我再看看可用的工具。`manage_graphics` 允许的操作有：apply_flow_layout, delete_widget, group_widgets, set_widget_style, create_rect, create_text, create_circle。\n\n没有直接的移动图元的方法。不过 `set_widget_style` 可以合并样式键到一个已有的widget上，也许可以通过设置位置样式来移动？但style参数是additionalProperties，没有明确说可以设置position。\n\n或者我可以通过 `manage_pages` 中的 create_widget 重新创建？不合适。\n\n实际上，目前可用的工具中确实没有\"移动widget\"或者\"update widget position\"的操作。所以我需要跟用户确认更多信息，或者看看能不能换个阶段。\n\n不过，在问用户之前，我应该先搞清楚用户指的是什么。信息太少了，我需要问：\n\n1. 是在哪个页面上？\n2. 图元的ID是什么？\n3. 具体往右移动多少像素/距离？\n\n让我先问问用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 406, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 5600.770200002444}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "faeb10cf-3602-452d-b500-758056e73d72", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-049", "text": "在不存在的missing_panel上添加一个泵图元", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.038Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.647Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.038Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.647Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 556, "latency_ms": 6592.99430000101, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您的需求我理解了——您想在页面 **missing_panel** 上添加一个泵图元。不过您也提到这个页面目前还不存在。\n\n为了帮您完成配置，我需要先确认一下：\n\n**这个 `missing_panel` 页面是否应该现在创建？** 比如：\n- 是否需要我创建一个名为 `missing_panel` 的新 HMI 页面（您可以指定分辨率和背景色，例如默认 1920×1080 白色背景）？\n- 然后在上面放置一个泵图元（pump widget）？\n\n请您确认，这样我就一步步帮您执行。", "reasoning": "用户想要在一个不存在的页面 \"missing_panel\" 上添加一个泵图元（pump widget）。我需要在 execute 阶段进行。\n\n首先，我需要确认这个页面是否存在。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT。\n\n实际上，这个页面还不存在，所以我不能直接在不存在页面上添加图元。我需要先创建页面，或者告知用户页面不存在。\n\n不过，根据工具描述，我应该先思考后再行动。\n\n\"missing_panel\" 这个页面并不存在，所以我需要先问问用户是否要创建这个页面，或者我直接创建它。\n\n让我先确认一下 - 用户说\"在不存在的missing_panel上添加一个泵图元\"，意思是页面不存在。但我不能在一个不存在的页面上创建 widget。\n\n我需要先创建这个页面（create_page），然后再在上面创建 widget（create_widget）。\n\n不过，创建页面是 manage_pages 工具中的 create_page action，这属于当前阶段可用的工具吗？\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具有很多，manage_pages 是其中之一。\n\n等等，让我再仔细看。当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，而可切换的下一阶段中有很多选项。但当前可用工具列表中列出了所有工具。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\n但 manage_pages 是可用工具，所以我可以直接使用。\n\n不过，页面 \"missing_panel\" 不存在，所以我需要先创建它，然后再在上面添加泵图元。\n\n让我先向用户说明情况，然后直接操作。\n\n或者，用户可能只是随口说\"不存在的\"，但实际意图是让我先创建页面再添加泵？让我先确认一下比较好。\n\n先询问用户是否要创建这个页面，然后再添加泵图元。\n\n实际上，根据准则第4条：\"若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认\"\n\n这里用户明确说\"不存在的missing_panel\"，他知道页面不存在。我需要问他是否要创建这个页面。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7750, "output_tokens": 556, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 6609.195199998794}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "06633636-d263-4c0c-ab26-3cb603d11da8", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-050", "text": "把那个图元往右挪一点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.457Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:22.773Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:13.457Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:22.773Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 807, "latency_ms": 9302.573400000256, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前我处于 **ANALYZE_INTENT（意图分析）** 阶段，但根据您的要求，我需要先跟您确认几个信息，因为当前的信息不足以执行操作：\n\n**问题：**\n\n1. **您指的是哪个页面上（page_id）的哪个图元（widget_id）？**  \n   例如，它叫什么名字？是什么类型的图元（矩形、圆形、文本、泵、罐等）？\n\n2. **具体往右挪多少？**  \n   比如像素数（例如 20 像素、50 像素等）？\n\n另外需要说明的是，当前可用的工具中**没有直接的\"移动图元\"操作**。可选的方案有：\n\n- **方案 A：通过 `apply_flow_layout` 重新布局**（但这是布局组的方式，不是精确移动单个元素）\n- **方案 B：删除后重新创建**（在更右边的位置，不太推荐，会丢失绑定关系）\n- **方案 C：如果后续阶段有更合适的工具**，我可以切换到其他阶段来查看是否有更好的能力\n\n请问您更倾向哪种方式？或者您能告诉我具体是哪个图元，我来看看最佳处理方式？", "reasoning": "The user wants to move a graphical element/widget to the right. However, I don't have enough information to proceed. I need to know:\n\n1. Which page the widget is on (page_id)\n2. Which widget to move (widget_id)\n3. How much to move it by\n\nLooking at the available tools in the current phase (ANALYZE_INTENT), I have:\n- manage_graphics with actions including set_widget_style (but that doesn't change position)\n\nWait, looking more carefully at the manage_graphics tool actions:\n- create_rect, create_text, create_circle - these are for creating, not moving\n- delete_widget - delete\n- group_widgets - group\n- set_widget_style - style only\n- apply_flow_layout - layout positioning\n\nThere's no explicit \"move widget\" action available. But `apply_flow_layout` can re-position widgets. However, that's a layout approach.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The current phase is ANALYZE_INTENT. I need to determine what the user wants and whether I have the right tools.\n\nThe user said \"把那个图元往右挪一点\" - move that graphical element a bit to the right.\n\nI don't have a tool that directly moves a widget to a specific position. The available actions don't include something like \"move_widget\" or \"set_widget_position\". \n\nLet me look again... `set_widget_style` is for styling (color, line_width, font_size). `apply_flow_layout` is for laying out multiple widgets.\n\nI don't have a tool to change widget position. So I need to switch to a phase where I could potentially handle this, or ask the user for more information.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-check. The manage_pages tool has `create_widget` and `bind_point`, but no move operation.\n\nLooking at all the tools available, there's no explicit \"move widget\" or \"set position\" operation. \n\nLet me think about what I can do. I should first ask the user for more details:\n\n1. Which page?\n2. Which widget?\n3. How far to the right?\n\nAnd also note that I don't have a direct \"move\" tool. Perhaps I could delete and recreate, but that's not ideal. Or maybe I should ask what the user means specifically.\n\nActually, I think the best course of action is to ask the user for clarification about which widget they're referring to and which page it's on, since I don't have enough context. I also need to note that there's no direct \"move\" tool available in the current set of tools.\n\nLet me ask the user for more information."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 807, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9316.894999999931}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "fcaa3f43-8c3e-457c-9d2e-160d9c5c93ef", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f40bf63656d8ef08e477da9e715f7b3bc8e16f985a61dbba9f189c5c47c1662a", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-050", "text": "把那个图元往右挪一点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.388Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:24.232Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:19.389Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T10:51:24.232Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 405, "latency_ms": 4828.847699998732, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您好！我需要先了解一些信息才能帮您操作。\n\n请问：\n1. **在哪一页（页面名称/ID）？**\n2. **要移动的图元叫什么（widget ID）？**\n3. **具体要往右挪多少像素？**\n\n另外，当前阶段的工具集中没有直接\"移动图元\"的动作，我需要切换到 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 或 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来处理位置调整。在您提供信息后，我会切换到合适的阶段进行处理。", "reasoning": "The user wants to move a graphical element (图元) to the right a bit. This is about modifying a widget's position on a page. However, looking at my available tools in the current phase (ANALYZE_INTENT), the `manage_graphics` tool doesn't have a \"move\" action. It has actions like `apply_flow_layout`, `delete_widget`, `group_widgets`, `set_widget_style`, `create_rect`, `create_text`, `create_circle`.\n\nThere's no direct \"move widget\" action available. The `set_widget_style` might allow setting position-related styles, but it's for style keys like color, line_width, font_size.\n\nLet me look at the `manage_pages` tool - it has `create_widget` but no move action.\n\nHmm, I don't have enough information to proceed. I need to know which page and which widget the user is referring to. Also, I don't have a direct tool to move widgets.\n\nLet me ask the user for clarification about which page and widget they're referring to. And I should also consider if I need to switch to a different phase to handle this.\n\nActually, let me first check what pages/widgets exist. But I don't have a tool to list pages or widgets either.\n\nLet me ask the user for more details - which page, which widget, and how much to move it to the right."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 30, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6788, "output_tokens": 405, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 4843.203899999935}, "judge": null}
